# HDZero Halo provisional defaults — offline bring-up only
# NOT VERIFIED — DO NOT FLASH
#
# Start at DShot300 (5); switch to DShot600 (6) after AM32 bench. Bi-dir via SERVO_BLH_BDMASK later.
MOT_PWM_TYPE 5

# MSP DisplayPort already defaulted in hwdef (OSD_TYPE 5 / SERIAL5 protocol 42)
# BARO_PROBE_EXT defaults to 1030 in hwdef (BMP280/MS5611/BMP388).
# No barometer: USB config-error recovery only, not normal flight startup.
# Do not auto-enable VTX 9V; reset/rail behaviour is unverified.
